        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_010_normal_06",
      "hash64": "5D196E5F176D506E",
      "text": "Well, whatever floats your boat, I suppose.\\nI’d never let myself get roped in like that...[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
